#     At 7.83 Hz update rate: ~4 kbps per node.
#     At city-scale (1000 nodes, coherent): ~4 Gbps aggregate.
#     At grid-scale (10^6 nodes): ~4 Tbps aggregate.
#     This is not theoretical — the physics is in the earthwander models.
